			"notes": "## DA Integration 2.0.4 for Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- The game would crash when changing the menu scale in the settings (due to an ImGui error: `WindowBorderHoverPadding > 0`) ([#16](https://github.com/bUmmy1337/da-integration/pull/16)).\n\n### For Addon Developers\n\n- A [wiki for creating addons](https://github.com/bUmmy1337/da-integration/tree/main/docs/wiki) is now available, along with an example addon located in `Modifications/ExampleAddon` ([#15](https://github.com/bUmmy1337/da-integration/pull/15)).\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Install Fabric Loader 0.19.5+ for Minecraft 26.3, along with the Fabric API.\n2. Replace the old mod JAR file in your `mods` folder with `daintegrate-2.0.4.jar`.\n\nFor the full list of changes in version 2.0, please refer to the release notes for [2.0.1](https://github.com/bUmmy1337/da-integration/releases/tag/26.3_2.0.1)."
		},
