			"notes": "## DA Integration 2.0.1 for Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric)\n\nA major update: the mod has been ported to Minecraft 26.3, received a new menu, fixed the Donation Alerts connection, and triggers can now do much more than just run commands.\n\n### What's New\n\n- **Minecraft 26.3.** Ported from 26.1.2 to 26.3 (Fabric Loader 0.19.5, Fabric API 0.161.0+26.3).\n- **New Dear ImGui Menu.** A dark, iOS-inspired \"glass\" style featuring Overview, Connection, Triggers, Settings, and Help tabs. Opens directly in-game.\n- **Easy Donation Alerts Connection.** Simply paste your secret widget token into the menu—no manual file editing required.\n- **Pop-up Notifications.** Donations appear as sleek \"pills\" on the screen with a customizable position.\n- **Action Triggers.** Beyond commands, triggers can now display a title, show action bar text, play a sound, or send a chat message. Parameters for each action are configured right in the menu.\n- **API for Other Mods.** Other mods can register custom actions via the `daintegrate` entrypoint (`DaIntegratePlugin`), and they will immediately appear in the triggers menu.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- The in-game menu rendered only as wireframe outlines without fill because ImGui triangles were being discarded by backface culling. Fixed ([#8](https://github.com/bUmmy1337/da-integration/pull/8)).\n- Fixed the Donation Alerts connection ([#1](https://github.com/bUmmy1337/da-integration/issues/1)): the old `socket.donationalerts.ru` address no longer exists; the mod now connects to `socket.donationalerts.com`.\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Install Fabric Loader 0.19.5+ for Minecraft 26.3 and Fabric API.\n2. Put `daintegrate-2.0.1.jar` into your `mods` folder.\n3. Open the mod menu in-game and paste your Donation Alerts token in the Connection tab.\n\n> ⚠️ If something isn't working, please open an issue."
		},
		{
